## LAMMPS input file of energy minimization for 1000 methane in Kerogen-Coasne-id01 without blocking spheres

## Units
units              real

## Boundary conditions
boundary           p p p
box tilt           large

## Required atom parameters
atom_style         atomic

## neighbour list
neigh_modify       delay 2 every 1

## Potential Style (must be defined before pair_coeff in data file)
pair_style         lj/cut 12.0

## Initial configuration file
read_data          75X_0DVB_4.data       

## mixing rules, pair coeffs are defined in data file
pair_modify        tail no 
pair_modify        mix arithmetic

## Define groups
group              methane type 6
group              material  type 7:12 

## Exclude material-material interactions
neigh_modify       exclude group material material
neigh_modify       exclude group methane methane

## Fix the Material
fix freeze material setforce 0.0 0.0 0.0

# ---------------- Minimization ----------------
min_style       cg
minimize        1.0e-4 1.0e-6 2000 20000

# ---------------- Output minimized coordinates ----------------
write_data      75X_0DVB_4_minimized.data



